{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01SHunnqWJHZnECEA7BRX1Fx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task carefully:\n\n1. I need to create two files:\n   - `pkg/testutils/difftest_test.go` - Unit tests for the RunDiffTests harness\n   - `pkg/testutils/testdata/testbin/main.go` - A configurable helper binary\n\n2. The tests need to cover:\n   - R1: RunDiffTests reports no failure when both binaries produce identical output\n   - R2: RunDiffTests detects divergence in stdout, stderr, or exit code\n   - R3: buildEnv sets LC_ALL=C by default and merges DiffTest.Env overrides\n   - R4: NormalizeFunc functions are applied before comparison\n\n3. Design decisions:\n   - D1: Single configurable Go program with flags for stdout, stderr, exit code\n   - D2: All tests run with LC_ALL=C\n   - D3: buildEnv and setEnvVar are testable directly since test is in same package\n\nNow I need to review the PRD and test suite specifications to understand the full requirements.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22532,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22532},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28ee6739-4ce8-4b54-842a-3c854f14f335","uuid":"ecdedc50-6cf4-4075-b434-7d827397781e"}
